{"title":"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> are there such that the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/a/adae8851c6782f9847241abafa273f8ba7ec35cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\lfloor x\\rfloor} = N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> has a solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, since otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/d/27d5883450a11db9f63e4bcaead39e0ee3498644.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\lfloor x\\rfloor}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"16\" /> would be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f599cdbbedb0e82e324f80733a8ea84be58bd340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> which is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e8228ff0064db1de4f81cc3c5c0639bbd53b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> must be an integer, let’s do case work based on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e8228ff0064db1de4f81cc3c5c0639bbd53b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" />:\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/9/7a9a19afe753b40316ddddac745fe41cfc2f9a9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffbf0e3d6449ddf18d2352976ba403dc41dd46b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> as long as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79c96e270e148516fb5dd4a73725d8be87c80c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />. This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/4/4e4dbd880789743eac14444827a95792cb010044.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> can be anything between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2df68d6d4d4045d166479ddd0251947d64a24d6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e68ad31d12ba3d14b80a9341ee44e6238555124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e68ad31d12ba3d14b80a9341ee44e6238555124.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffbf0e3d6449ddf18d2352976ba403dc41dd46b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />. However, we got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffbf0e3d6449ddf18d2352976ba403dc41dd46b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> in case 1 so it got counted twice.\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/daf86e992cfae02a6e6de6d8c631f4daacb2d83b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> can be anything between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819068968ed60608a91d0c3921d6296964660e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819068968ed60608a91d0c3921d6296964660e9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/a/aea415f57d0c4d650e609a7a2b347f83ef1d0095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2-2^2=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />'s\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583232482298c5560d95b1b9beb9fe4ad47314b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> can be anything between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4aaecd00c115e0a1f5d807ac00b10f428d07993.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cbcd610fcf15a9656621a625edaf9340fa576c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cbcd610fcf15a9656621a625edaf9340fa576c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/deb6b495b9638570a2ea3987ea0bd327793d7f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^3-3^3=37$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />'s\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/8895a8744988acbf7fc6d77ee3d32ca4fca35bf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> can be anything between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d74a82a8242b992d784a77944e00b6869a23ced9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5df324769ac1365d3b379a13a1f21c3333e9952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^4$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> excluding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5df324769ac1365d3b379a13a1f21c3333e9952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^4$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/6/cf6cf66ea742f1ea8095d87c4aa0bdbf88f737b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^4-4^4=369$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />'s\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we can stop here and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4acc1dccd76dfa2e642a62ca6bd997b97b1bb47c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+5+37+369= \\boxed {412}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"193\" height=\"23\" /> possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Alternatively, one could find that the values which work are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/0/ba033917e45005a1666e9bb63f7c8e3712681a02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^1,\\ 2^2,\\ 3^3,\\ 4^4,\\ \\sqrt{5}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt{5}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt{6}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt{6}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt{7}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt{7}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt{8}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt{8}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt[3]{28}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{28}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt[3]{29}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{29}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt[3]{30}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{30}\\rfloor},\\ ...,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"673\" height=\"28\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e93d1e8afb6e5fd0c39a468310bd74d7cce570.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ \\sqrt[3]{63}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{63}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt[4]{257}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[4]{257}\\rfloor},\\ \\sqrt[4]{258}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[4]{258}\\rfloor},\\ ...,\\ \\sqrt[4]{624}^{\\lfloor\\sqrt[4]{624}\\rfloor}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"411\" height=\"28\" /> to get the same answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, we find the number of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab87858e0f52df90e2a48f758e5b6663fb34f2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> has a solution with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e6a49ac86afe987e415b394866aa5a685492033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\lfloor x\\rfloor}=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/6/bc6d45f52c710e60a3b2a58c19c9f67d84d0c4fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt[k]{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, and because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/9/769656f17cfe0bc244d26401001560a427ac2236.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\le x &lt; k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/2/ac25149787fac90fbecbd1ad53089c8b8e2afbcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^k \\le x^k &lt; (k+1)^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"22\" />, and because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4577b4637413dbe79c5fdd7bf17b360d73d5b46d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k+1)^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" /> is an integer, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fcbe616b6a869ad5fb6f00d8ee7fe013775ba42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^k \\le x^k \\le (k+1)^k-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" />. The number of possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e973203144975e93c31bdba139c105891889743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^k$\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> is equal to the number of integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/8/3882fca89ef35a3cb771bf312f64d97acbdd8605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^k$\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b752cf67e9f2b3a33be6b6f11e8f4f09dae8a13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k+1)^k-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"22\" /> inclusive, which is equal to the larger number minus the smaller number plus one or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91e7b15fc2a54c3b83990be8a9215843463f9fb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((k+1)^k-1)-(k^k)+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" />, and this is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/2/4722c781a6275095ee24013071262743753c9266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k+1)^k-k^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8b57d9b5385406a194d393db9d6b7e1bc42ef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e973203144975e93c31bdba139c105891889743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^k$\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, so we only need to consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/6088be3d938441de5370e3109df6a928106d432e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\le 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. The requested number of values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is the same as the number of values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e973203144975e93c31bdba139c105891889743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^k$\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee58628c45daf82c7403bc1e745c739ee3bf74bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum^{4}_{k=1} [(k+1)^k-k^k]=2-1+9-4+64-27+625-256=\\boxed{412}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"510\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Mostly the above solution explained on video: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Xzjh6ae0MU&amp;t=11s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Xzjh6ae0MU&amp;t=11s</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kALrIDMR0dg\">https://youtu.be/kALrIDMR0dg</a>\n</p><p>~Shreyas S\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Projective Solution: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fUef_tVnM5M\">https://youtu.be/fUef_tVnM5M</a>\n</p><p>~Shreyas S\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I\" title=\"2009 AIME I\">2009 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/